<title>USA: NewMil names president Francis Wiatr CEO.</title>
<headline>NewMil names president Francis Wiatr CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW MILFORD, Conn. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>NewMil Bancorp Tuesday named its president Francis Wiatr chief executive and chairman of the company and its sole subsidiary, New Milford Savings Bank.</p>
<p>Wiatr replaces Anthony Nania who is retiring as chairman September 1, the bank holding company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Wiatr has been president and chief executive of New Milford Savings Bank and president of the holding company since 1994. He was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
